                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Indoor or outdoor fan motor</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Noise, weak airflow, error code</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Yes, unless the system is very old</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Inverter control board</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">No start, error codes, erratic operation</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Under warranty or under about 10 years</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-gray-50 border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Refrigerant leak at flare</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Weak heating or cooling, frosting</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Yes, if the leak is found and repaired</td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr class="bg-white border-b border-gray-100">
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 font-black text-gray-900">Compressor</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Will not run, trips breaker, no heat or cool</td>
                    <td class="px-4 py-4 text-gray-700">Rarely out of warranty on an older system</td>
